A [`bytes`](https://docs.geldata.com/reference/stdlib/bytes#type::std::bytes) value can be converted to a [`str`](https://docs.geldata.com/reference/stdlib/string#type::std::str) using UTF-8 encoding. Returns an InvalidValueError if input UTF-8 is invalid.

